/-!
# Ordinary three-rank of the concrete J3 model

The imported construction gives an explicit elementary abelian subgroup of
order 27, hence the unconditional lower bound `3 ≤ primeRank 3 Model`.
The upper bound awaits certification of a subgroup of order 243 whose elements
of order three lie in this elementary subgroup, the ambient order certificate,
and the bridge from abelian generator rank to first-omega cardinality.

Sources: Aschbacher–Smith, Lemma A.2.19, printed p. 41 (PDF p. 52);
GLS, volume 3, Tables 5.3h and 5.6.1.
-/
